  "description": "Web crawling capabilities for WebSpark.HttpClientUtility: SiteCrawler and SimpleSiteCrawler with \n\t\t\trobots.txt compliance, HTML link extraction (HtmlAgilityPack), sitemap generation (Markdig), \n\t\t\tCSV export (CsvHelper), and real-time SignalR progress updates. Requires WebSpark.HttpClientUtility \n\t\t\tbase package [2.0.0]. Install both packages and call AddHttpClientUtility() + AddHttpClientCrawler() \n\t\t\tin your DI registration.",
